  "data_collection_title": "Data Collection",
  "data_collection_content": "We only collect information necessary to provide our fitness services, including: account information (name, phone), body data (height, weight, age, gender), and workout records (exercise type, duration, calories burned, etc.). We do not collect personal information unrelated to our services.",
  "data_usage_title": "Data Usage",
  "data_usage_content": "Your data is only used to: provide and improve fitness services, generate personalized workout recommendations, track your fitness progress, and provide customer support. We will never sell your personal data to third parties.",
  "health_data_title": "Health Data Processing",
  "health_data_content": "Health data recorded in the app (such as heart rate, sleep, water intake, etc.) is stored only in your personal account and encrypted. This data is used to provide health analysis and recommendations, not for other commercial purposes.",
  "data_storage_title": "Data Storage & Security",
  "data_storage_content": "We use industry-standard encryption to protect your data. All data transmission uses SSL/TLS encryption, and stored data uses AES-256 encryption. We conduct regular security audits to ensure your data safety.",
  "third_party_title": "Third-Party Sharing",
  "third_party_content": "We do not share your data with third parties except: with your explicit consent, as required by law, to protect user safety. We sign strict data protection agreements with third-party service providers.",
  "user_rights_title": "Your Rights",
  "user_rights_content": "You have the right to: access and view your personal data, correct inaccurate information, delete your account and data, export your data, and withdraw data usage consent. To exercise these rights, please contact us via the privacy email.",
