  "children_privacy_content": "This app is not intended for children under 14. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we discover that children's data has been inadvertently collected, we will delete it immediately.",
  "policy_updates_title": "Policy Updates",
  "policy_updates_content": "We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Significant changes will be notified through in-app notifications or email. Continued use of the app indicates your agreement to the updated privacy policy.",
